Description: Argon ONE V5 Essential Case & Performance Configuration (Raspberry Pi 5)
 Configures all hardware features and safe, distro-agnostic performance
 optimizations for the Argon ONE V5 Raspberry Pi 5 case (with or without OLED):
  - Front USB 2.0 ports (dwc2 host mode) and full USB current budget
  - UART0 shutdown detection & Pi 5 EEPROM (PSU_MAX_CURRENT=5000, POWER_OFF_ON_HALT=1, SDRAM_BANKLOW=1)
  - M.2 NVMe slot activation, PCIe Gen 3 speed, and PCIe ASPM performance policy
  - Safe 2800 MHz CPU boost (V3D GPU left at standard)
  - Direct-scheduler CPU governor (schedutil @ 1ms rate limit + 10ms ondemand tuning)
  - Responsive 4-stage kernel PWM fan curve (0% CPU overhead)
  - 4-Core Network RPS/RFS + GICv2 Hardware Interrupt Distribution (dwc2/v3d/vc4)
  - Low-CPU LZ4 ZRAM compression, physical LPDDR4X RAM priority (swappiness=15), TCP BBR + fq
